    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting-measurement-out-of-phase-sox9-cartilage-vs-gdf5-interzone-spatial-correlation-r-sox9-gdf5-reference> a schema:PropertyValue ;
